"RTN","C0FHIRSET",31,0)
 S DESC(8)=" "
"RTN","C0FHIRSET",32,0)
 S DESC(9)="OUTPUT:"
"RTN","C0FHIRSET",33,0)
 S DESC(10)="  Returns a FHIR R4 Bundle (Collection) as a Global Array."
"RTN","C0FHIRSET",34,0)
