 F  S IFN=$O(^OR(100,"AC",DFN,IFN)) Q:'IFN  D
"RTN","C0FHIRTG",36,0)
 . S ORPK=$P($G(^OR(100,IFN,4)),U)
"RTN","C0FHIRTG",37,0)
 . I ORPK'="",ORPK["R",'$D(^PSRX(+ORPK)) S CNT=CNT+1
"RTN","C0FHIRTG",38,0)
 I CNT>0 W "[FAIL] found "_CNT_" broken links from Order (#100) to Rx (#52)."
